* Next meeting will be Thursday July 18th, 7:00pm at the BRIDGETON
  TRAILS County Library (See below for directions)

* This months presentation - PGP - Public Key Encryption
  by Matthew Feldt

* The St. Louis Linux Users Group is back on the web - check it out
  at http://www.cs.umsl.edu/~feldt/sluugls and now so is SLUUG -
  http://michelob.wustl.edu

