G'day,

This list now has a new maintainer and a new web site. I would
like to thank Andrew Cosgriff for the time and effort he has put into the
list before it was handed over to me.

A new feature of the list is that it is maintained in SGML.
As such, other distribution formats are now easily feasible. If you
have a need for the list in formats other than HTML and text, please
let me know.

If you have any sugguests please feel free to send them to me at
query@free-unix.apana.org.au.

Eric Yeo

- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

If you have any additions and/or comments on this list, please
send mail to query@free-unix.apana.org.au. (If you simply use and/or
like the list, we'd also like to hear from you).


We CANNOT guarantee that this list is completely up to date (or
accurate) 100% of the time, so we'd REALLY appreciate updates.

You can get the list by one of the following methods :

   o  From the USENET newsgroups
                aus.computers.linux
                aus.computers
                comp.os.linux.announce
                comp.unix.bsd.freebsd.announce
                comp.unix.bsd.netbsd.announce

   o  by WWW from http://free-unix.apana.org.au

   o  by sending mail to info@free-unix.apana.org.au.

