  1.  User Groups

  Format of each entry is as follows :

  <name>

  Started : <date group started>

  Meeting Time : <time and date that the group meets>

  Meeting Place : <where to go>

  Organiser / President / Secretary, etc : <as per usual>

  Contact address : <who to ask for more information about the club>

