I just uploaded man-1.4h to the usual places (ftp.win.tue.nl, sunsite.unc.edu
and tsx-11.mit.edu) - on the latter two sites it may still be in [Ii]ncoming.

Almost nothing has been changed, but shortly after eachother
I received Danish, Italian and Spanish versions of the man pages
and messages, so I made a new release to include these.

Not all versions of grep understand the -s option (`status only' or `silent'),
and many distributions include a grep that uses -q for the same purpose.
So, configure now tests the behaviour of the local grep.

Comments are welcome as always.

Andries

