What's new?
===========

1. A new effect called "FgGrad" that looks much like Shadow, but here,
   XBanner fills the foreground part of the text with a color gradient.
2. You can now have XBanner put an image on your screen. Particularly
   effective with Larry Ewing's Penguin Logo!
3. A new program is now part of the distribution. The 'xb_check' program
   will validate your resource files for you.
4. The home page now features binaries for Linux. Both static-linked and
   dynamic-linked versions are available.
5. The home page has been changed considerably. Quite some effort was put
   into the graphics part.

What Is XBanner?
- ----------------
Do you run XDM? Does your system load the X-Window system and then asks for
your username/password? If this is the case XBanner can make that login
screen look much much nicer.

XBanner simpy takes the text you tell it to, and draws it onto the screen
in a font of your choice. It renders an effect that you can choose for you
and some of these effects can look awsome.

